<string name="last_update_info">🐞 Fixes for possible application crashes in call history</string>

<string name="last_update_info897">⌚ From now on, the caller\'s name will also be displayed on your smartwatch. Another new feature is the ability to tap on the number that is calling you and if you have spam testing turned on, a website with reviews of that number will open. Please support the app by rating it in the store, it costs nothing and you will help others with their choice. Every ⭐ counts!</string>


<string name="last_update_info894">🐞 Fixed an issue where the call history was not displaying fully on certain phone models. Please support the app by rating it in the store, it costs nothing and helps others make their choice. Every ⭐ counts!</string>

<string name="last_update_info885">In this new version, the graphical appearance of notifications has been completely redesigned. If you have multiple SIMs, you will also see a SIM note in the notification.</string>

<string name="last_update_info853">In this new version you have the option to connect to applications that check unknown numbers for spam. Thanks to the emoji 🎣🤖🗣️🥊💰🛒🏢📓 displayed right next to the number, you will know if it is spam! More info on my website...</string>

